      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "scope",
      "text": "Aspose.3D FOSS for Java reads and writes 3D scene data in .fbx, .glb, .gltf, .obj, and .stl formats, and provides a subset of the commercial Aspose.3D API for Java developers targeting Java 21."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
