        "inherited_unit:072.list"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:1",
      "text": "Only STL (import and export) is fully functional in the published 26.5.0 package; OBJ import is present in the upstream source but ships as a stub in the published Maven Central artifact, and several other recognized formats fail silently rather than throwing an error when used."
    },
    {
